{"id": "t010-003", "text": "Owen had his knee operation on Tuesday. He sounded groggy but fine when I rang. Should text him at the weekend to see how the physio is going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "groggy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I rang"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t010-005", "text": "Zainab mentioned her dad is having a hip replacement on 2 November 2026 at St James's. He's been on the waiting list for nearly two years, so it's a relief, but he's terrified of anaesthetic. She's taking the week off to look after him, and her brother Obi is covering the following week. Remind me to message Zainab on the 2nd to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly two years"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified of anaesthetic", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "covering", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Zainab", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t010-007", "text": "Met Mei's partner Hugo for the first time. He's a structural engineer and they rent a flat in Clapham with a very fat cat called Biscuit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "structural engineer", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "rent a flat in Clapham", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "fat cat called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t010-012", "text": "Zara passed her driving test this morning on her third go! Mum's taking her out for dinner tonight to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t010-013", "text": "Lwazi said his little girl lost her first tooth and the tooth fairy has been very generous. He also mentioned she starts swimming lessons on October 12th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost her first tooth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "swimming lessons", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 12th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t010-017", "text": "Lukas called to say his shoulder surgery has been moved from 9 December to January 14th because the surgeon is off sick. He's frustrated because he'd already arranged cover at work and his mum had booked trains down to help. Now he has to sort it all again, and he's in a lot of pain most nights. Must check in with him around Christmas, and maybe offer to drive him to the hospital on the day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "shoulder surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 9 December"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to January 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "frustrated", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a lot of pain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "most nights"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "around Christmas", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to drive him to the hospital", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t010-018", "text": "Olivia's twins finished primary school today. Big assembly, lots of crying, mostly from Olivia.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finished primary school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t010-020", "text": "Theo is waiting on his A-level results and keeps saying he's failed everything. Results day is August 13. I should text him good luck the night before, and then remember to ask him how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A-level results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 13", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t010-024", "text": "Ximena works remotely for a design studio in Barcelona and spends winters in Mexico City with her family.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works remotely for a design studio", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "spends winters in Mexico City", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t010-029", "text": "Owen is a primary school teacher in Reading. Year 2. Loves it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "primary school teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Year 2", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t010-030", "text": "Mei said her nephew Theo starts nursery on Monday and she's worried he won't settle because he's never been away from his mum.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nephew", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried he won't settle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t010-033", "text": "Jen's eldest, Olivia, has her first ballet exam on June 21st. Jen says she's been practising in the kitchen every night and has worn a hole in her tights already. Olivia is seven now and wants to be a dancer when she grows up, apparently. Their youngest, Theo, starts nursery the week after, so it's a big month for them. Ask Jen how the exam went afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first ballet exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 21st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "seven", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to be a dancer", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she grows up"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "youngest", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Jen how the exam went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t010-037", "text": "Spoke to Asha about her grandad on the phone. He fell in the garden last week, broke his wrist, and is now in a cast for six weeks. She says he's being very stubborn about letting anyone help, insists on doing his own shopping. He's 88 and lives on his own in Leicester since her nan died. Asha is going up most weekends but she's worn out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fell", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke his wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stubborn about letting anyone help", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "insists on doing his own shopping", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "88", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives on his own in Leicester", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "most weekends", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "worn out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t010-038", "text": "Nora's son Isaac graduates from Leeds on 7/16. She's been hinting that a nice frame for the graduation photo would be the perfect present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from Leeds", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7/16", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hinting that a nice frame for the graduation photo would be the perfect present", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t010-040", "text": "Olga is a nurse on the orthopaedic ward at the General. She's lived in this country since 2008 and her daughter is at uni in Glasgow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olga", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nurse on the orthopaedic ward at the General", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lived in this country", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since 2008"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "at uni in Glasgow", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t010-042", "text": "Gym at 7, then the big shop. Haven't got anything planned for Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "the big shop", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}]}
{"id": "t010-043", "text": "Ciara Brennan from work says her son Owen is sitting his eleven-plus on September 13th. He's so nervous he's not sleeping and has been getting stomach aches before school. She's trying not to put any pressure on him, and his dad is taking him to the test so she doesn't make it worse. She asked me to keep it quiet. Results come out in mid-October.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara Brennan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eleven-plus", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 13th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before school"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Results", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in mid-October", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t010-048", "text": "Had coffee with Ximena this afternoon. Her daughter Zara has her university interview at Cambridge on December 8th for natural sciences and has been revising nonstop since half term. Ximena is more stressed than Zara, if anything, and keeps checking the train times. Her husband is driving them up the night before so they don't have to rush. Text Zara good luck the day before, and ask Ximena how it went once they're home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "university interview at Cambridge", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since half term"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Zara good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Ximena how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "once they're home", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t010-049", "text": "Alejandro finished chemo last Friday! The video of him ringing the bell was lovely, the whole ward clapping. He says the tiredness is the worst part now, and he's still not allowed back to work until the new year. His next scan is in February 2027, which he's trying not to think about. He's going to Spain with his sister Nadia in March to celebrate, their first trip together since they were kids.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finished chemo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "tiredness", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back to work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "next scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Spain", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "since they were kids"}]}
{"id": "t010-053", "text": "Mei works in a lab at Imperial, something to do with proteins. Her parents live in Singapore and she visits every Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in a lab at Imperial", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "something to do with proteins", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "live in Singapore", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visits", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t010-054", "text": "Noor's dad is in hospital again with pneumonia, the second time this year. She's going straight there after work every day and hardly sleeping. Her brother Darius flies in from Dubai on Thursday to help, and her aunt is coming down at the weekend. Noor said the doctors are hopeful but it's slow going. I should send her a message tomorrow and offer to do a school run or two.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going straight there", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work every day", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies in from Dubai", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to do a school run", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t010-056", "text": "Isaac and Reggie are doing a sponsored walk for the hospice on May 9th in memory of their dad. I should sponsor them both.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sponsored walk", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor them both", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t010-058", "text": "Olivia is recovering from a C-section, so she's not driving until at least 11/28. Her partner Gintaras is working from home to help. I need to pop round with a meal next week, maybe Wednesday or Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "C-section", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until at least 11/28"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "working from home", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round with a meal", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe Wednesday or Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
